# PX4 params for a STANDARD QUAD (x500, SYS_AUTOSTART 4001) flown with
# tail-sitter-style transitions by tailsitter_emulation. No VTOL params needed.
# Load with QGroundControl (Vehicle Setup > Parameters > Tools > Load) or let
# the script set them with --apply-params.
#
# Format: Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type(9=float)
1	1	MPC_XY_VEL_MAX	15.0	9
1	1	MPC_TILTMAX_AIR	45.0	9
1	1	MPC_ACC_HOR_MAX	5.0	9
1	1	MPC_ACC_HOR	5.0	9
1	1	MPC_JERK_AUTO	8.0	9
